> [Leader] in the heating, ventilation, air conditioning and refrigeration sectors for[ 65 years], and recognized as one of Canada’s Best Managed Companies since[ 2010]; The Master Group is the largest independent HVAC-R distributor in Canada. The company now[ employs] over 800 dynamic and devoted individuals who serve the industry in over 34 branches and 4[ distribution] centres spanning from[ Alberta] to the[ Atlantic] Provinces, and 6 new point of sales to[ open]in[ Alberta] and[ BC within] the[ next year]. For more information,[ visit] www.master.ca.

