> [Twenty] years ago[,] K[erm] and Sallie Campbell[ learned about] the listing of a[ gorgeous] 120-acre farm near[ S]uttons Bay,[ complete] with a plantation-style home, centennial barn and indoor and outdoor equestrian facility. Rounding up three partners and a[ young] win[emaker], Black Star Farms[ began].
Happy[ birthday],[ Black Star Farms]!
